"This extension will load the core `micrometer` extension as well as "
"additional library dependencies required to support\n"
"prometheus."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you already have your Quarkus project configured, you can add the "
"`micrometer-registry-prometheus` extension\n"
"to your project by running the following command in your project base "
"directory:"
msgstr ""

